1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:10,064
Arsenal 2 will help us attack production
bottlenecks with the footprint to add up to 9
million production hours per year into our
submarine supply chain.
Arsenal 2 将帮助我们突破生产瓶颈，预计
每年可为潜艇供应链新增 900 万工时。

2
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:14,470
That's a 15% surge in total capacity.
这使总产能提升 15%。

3
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,539
This is not a smaller business for our ship
builders.
这不是在缩减造船业务，而是要扩大规模。

4
00:00:17,614 --> 00:00:19,051
It is a larger one.
我们的造船业务只会扩大。

5
00:00:19,127 --> 00:00:33,749
More hulls through our prime yards at better
margin, improving with every boat as our
workforce gets faster at the same work that
drives up our rate and ensures we meet and
eventually exceed 1 plus two.
我们的主要造船厂将以更高利润率建造更多舰艇。随着
每艘艇的生产流程日益熟练、效率不断提升，我们会提
高产量，确保达到并最终超过“1+2”的目标。

6
00:00:33,759 --> 00:00:37,894
Now, we will not win this race with just new
technology and new buildings.
现在，我们不会仅仅凭借新技术和新建筑来赢得这场比
赛。

7
00:00:37,962 --> 00:00:48,796
Just as a submarine is nothing without a well-
trained and resilient crew, our shipyards and
industrial base rely on the skilled hands and
dedication of the American worker.
正如没有训练有素、适应力强的船员，潜艇就不算什么
一样，我们的造船厂和工业基地依赖于美国工人熟练的
双手和奉献精神。

8
00:00:48,876 --> 00:00:55,800
Arsenal 2 will create over 3,100 high-skilled
American jobs right here in Maryland.
Arsenal 2将在马里兰州创造超过3,100
个高技能的美国工作岗位。
